enroll (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace --fqdn with explicit --host/--extend for strictly checked multi-host
    projects; share role logic while promoting differing artifacts into per-host
    inventory, and publish extensions atomically on Linux.
  * Make live firewall and sysctl capture opt-in; optionally persist captured
    firewall state across reboot.
  * Improve Debian and RPM service/package attribution, prerequisite ordering,
    selective service activation, and drift reporting.
  * Harden credential screening, unsafe inputs, role names, and staged output;
    preserve account identity mappings and observe automatic dependencies.

